      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Website lead → CRM sheet + Telegram\nA form or chat widget POSTs `{ name, phone, email, message }` to this webhook. The lead is validated and normalised. **Emergencies (gas, CO, smoke, sparks) skip the queue** and page the owner at once; everything else is appended to the Leads tab and announced.\n\nThe webhook answers in both cases, so the website never hangs.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cf6ee3e9-75fb-4fc8-a9ea-66da31fb73c8",
      "name": "Lead webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
